{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/","title":"중천 EX-UE3","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 중천의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"중천 EX-UE3\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-UE3\n위치\n손등쪽 손목주름(the dorsal wrist crease) 위, 陽谿(LI5)와 陽池(TE4)의 중간지점.\n취혈\n손바닥을 아래로 하고, 陽谿(LI5)와 陽池(TE4)의 중간지점의 오목한 곳에서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.3～0.5寸\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-UE3","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_2","text":"손등쪽 손목주름(the dorsal wrist crease) 위, 陽谿(LI5)와 陽池(TE4)의 중간지점.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_3","text":"손바닥을 아래로 하고, 陽谿(LI5)와 陽池(TE4)의 중간지점의 오목한 곳에서 취혈한다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_4","text":"直刺 0.3～0.5寸","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-EBC3045492456D8E","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue3/","text_sha256":"bd3a7b3381ecaa78c8b29f0e7489d6b314f6cc2a851967ac98a3ce42e69d9221","source_sha256":"d879a8f7555a3ce9688a12cfd0db38ec83b55f0a131146c0fa8ee4dc216e6c1f","commit":"90ee7e6f8032ea5b3f42c16063f7190e6f2cd987"}}
